      "text": "𝐌𝐮𝐦𝐛𝐚𝐢 𝐓𝐫𝐚𝐟𝐟𝐢𝐜 𝐀𝐥𝐞𝐫𝐭: 𝐌𝐚𝐣𝐨𝐫 𝐂𝐮𝐫𝐛𝐬 𝐨𝐧 𝐖𝐞𝐬𝐭𝐞𝐫𝐧 𝐄𝐱𝐩𝐫𝐞𝐬𝐬 𝐇𝐢𝐠𝐡𝐰𝐚𝐲 𝐌𝐨𝐧𝐝𝐚𝐲 | \n\nKey Traffic Advisory (Quick Facts)\n•Date: February 17, 2026\n\n•All vehicles Restricted \nFrom 8:00 AM to 9:00 PM\n\n•Day long 13 hour Complete prohibition on Heavy Motor Vehicles (HMVs)\n\n•Affected Stretch: Western Express Highway\n•From Vakola Flyover to Dahisar Toll Naka\n•Both northbound & southbound carriageways",
